{"id": 8137262497990, "title": "Momcozy KleanPal Pro Baby Bottle Washer and Sterilizer", "body_html": "<p>Complete Bottle Care in One Machine – Wash, sterilize, dry, and store up to 4 bottles in one fully automatic cycle, giving busy parents more time for what matters most. Powerful, Thorough Cleaning – With 22,000Pa water pressure, 26 multi-angle jets, and a triple-layer spray system, it reaches bottles and accessories inside and out, with Rapid Wash completed in as little as 19 minutes. Steam Sterilization &amp; Hygienic Storage – 212°F steam sterilization, dual-layer drying, and up to 72 hours of hygienic storage help keep feeding essentials clean, dry, and ready to use. Made for Your Full Feeding Kit – Designed for wide- and narrow-neck bottles, wearable pump parts, sippy cups, silicone tableware, pacifiers, teethers, and more. Flexible for Everyday Life – Choose from 9 mode combinations to match different cleaning needs and newborn routines. Trusted by over 600,000 families worldwide, every KleanPal Pro includes 60 official Momcozy washer tablets and a 1-year warranty for added peace of mind.</p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Washer", "created_at": "2024-04-29T04:58:28-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-kleanpal-pro-baby-bottle-washer", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:21-04:00", "published_at": "2024-04-29T04:58:28-04:00", "template_suffix": "bs003-new", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "bottle sterilizer and dryer, bottle washer, Breastfeeding supplies, Top100_Sales, 喂养", "variants": [{"id": 44190972772550, "product_id": 8137262497990, "title": "White", "price": "299.99", "sku": "BS003-GW10NB-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": "shopify", "option1": "White", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-10-21T05:02:33-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:21-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "196415245218", "grams": 0, "image_id": 42774823338182, "weight": 0.0, "weight_unit": "kg